    "method_limit": "Same familiar public Servo rows under a new group partition; one real/permuted pair each, not independent populations. CPU-generated seed history, no long model-generated campaign or memory isolation. Both know the development champion; absence of reads need not imply incapability. Projection omits some potentially useful producer metadata; full qualifier and all observation values/scopes/validation/evaluator identities remain. Do not claim pure no-information-loss compression, isolated causality, broad quality/efficiency gain or completed long-history acceptance.",
    "new_effect": "516 actual distinct seed candidates per project. B vs A1better/1equal; actual Servo final MSE0.09138150 vs0.14545214 (37.174182%lower). Negative both identical mean predictions but3.849742%worse than initial kNN. A/B5APIcalls each; B total time2.680675%higher. B cited an additional first-page record and used measured bias for a better program, but no explicit read occurred in all10 responses.",
