  "reproduction": "Full frozen data/splits;516 actual initial candidates per project; all prompts/responses/usage; complete unchanged programs and source approvals; final selections/refit predictions; native process closure and CPU settlement. One zero-API native smoke and four actual formal workflows. Study-only projection retains observation values, validation, scopes, evaluator identities, artifact IDs, current attempts and evidence identity after original qualification. It omits artifact-to-producer mappings that may be useful in other research; no claim of complete information equivalence or default runtime change. Replay requires fresh project identities and configured paths, not automatic paid replay. Raw captures intentionally retain duplicated provenance; compression time is reported separately; readback and publication time were not separately instrumented.",
